           05  ED-REM               PIC 9(10).99.

       01  WS-REASON                PIC X(50).
       01  I                        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT INFILE
           OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
               READ INFILE
                   AT END
                       MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
                   NOT AT END
                       PERFORM PROCESS-ONE
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM

           CLOSE INFILE
           CLOSE OUTFILE
           STOP RUN.

       PROCESS-ONE.
           PERFORM PARSE-INPUT
           PERFORM CHECK-APPLICATION.

       PARSE-INPUT.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-FIELDS
           UNSTRING IN-REC DELIMITED BY ';'
               INTO WS-ID WS-NAME WS-LOAN-X WS-PROP-X WS-DOWN-X
                    WS-TERM-X WS-RATE-X
           END-UNSTRING

           COMPUTE LOAN-AMT ROUNDED =
               FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-LOAN-X) / 100
           COMPUTE PROP-VALUE ROUNDED =
               FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-PROP-X) / 100
           COMPUTE DOWN-PAY ROUNDED =
               FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-DOWN-X) / 100
           COMPUTE TERM-YEARS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TERM-X)
           COMPUTE TERM-MONTHS = TERM-YEARS * 12
           COMPUTE RATE-ANN ROUNDED =
               FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RATE-X) / 100.

       CHECK-APPLICATION.
           COMPUTE MIN-DOWN ROUNDED = PROP-VALUE * 0.15

           IF DOWN-PAY < MIN-DOWN
               MOVE "INSUFFICIENT FUNDS FOR DOWN PAYMENT" TO WS-REASON
               PERFORM WRITE-DENY
           ELSE
               PERFORM WRITE-APPRO
               PERFORM BUILD-SCHEDULE
           END-IF.

       WRITE-DENY.
           MOVE SPACES TO OUT-REC
           STRING WS-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  "DENY " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-REASON DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO OUT-REC
           END-STRING
